# Optional. Enables real William Hill odds on the Soccer tab via The Odds
# API (the-odds-api.com — free tier, 500 requests/month). Sign up there to
# get a key. (We originally targeted bet365, but confirmed against a live
# response that bet365 isn't in The Odds API's bookmaker list at all —
# they're notoriously resistant to third-party odds aggregation — so
# William Hill is used instead.) Without this set, the Soccer tab's
# William Hill entries fall back to clearly-tagged demo data; Polymarket
# and Kalshi are unaffected either way (they need no key).
ODDS_API_KEY=
